   "guideline": "When the domain is too heterogeneous for a fixed schema, discover the schema from the data and measure extraction quality as graph quality.",
   "evidence": "Amazon's product graph treats schema discovery as a learning problem because product types and attributes change continuously (`schema-discovered-not-designed`). Grade B source: a keynote, no peer-reviewed system paper.",
